---
// src/components/Footer.astro
const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="w-full bg-[#0b131b] border-t border-slate-800 text-slate-400 text-sm">
  <div class="w-full max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-14 sm:py-20">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-10 md:gap-8 pb-12 border-b border-slate-800/80">
      
      <!-- Brand & Mission -->
      <div class="md:col-span-4 flex flex-col items-start">
        <a href="#" class="inline-block mb-4">
          <img 
            src="/logo.png" 
            alt="Logo 4Loop" 
            class="h-7 w-auto object-contain brightness-0 invert" 
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </a>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-400 leading-relaxed mb-6 max-w-sm">
          L'ecosistema pensato per chiudere il cerchio dei rifiuti tessili post-consumo. Tracciabilità, valorizzazione dei materiali e coinvolgimento attivo di cittadini, brand e territori.
        </p>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-semibold text-slate-300">
          <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[#1cb829]"></span>
          <span>Economia Circolare Phygital</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Navigazione Rapida -->
      <div class="md:col-span-2 flex flex-col gap-3">
        <span class="text-xs font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">
          Navigazione
        </span>
        <a href="#processo" class="text-xs sm:text-sm hover:text-white transition-colors">Come funziona</a>
        <a href="#impatto" class="text-xs sm:text-sm hover:text-white transition-colors">Impatto</a>
        <a href="#ecosistema" class="text-xs sm:text-sm hover:text-white transition-colors">Ecosistema</a>
        <a href="#faq" class="text-xs sm:text-sm hover:text-white transition-colors">FAQ</a>
        <a href="#registrati" class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-[#1cb829] font-medium hover:underline">Unisciti</a>
      </div>

      <!-- Punti di Raccolta Attivi -->
      <div class="md:col-span-3 flex flex-col gap-2.5">
        <span class="text-xs font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">
          Punti attivi (VR)
        </span>
        <span class="text-xs text-slate-400">Lavanderia Lava_ti • Caldiero</span>
        <span class="text-xs text-slate-400">Lavanderia Lava_ti • Illasi</span>
        <span class="text-xs text-slate-400">Lavanderia L'oblo • Soave</span>
        <span class="text-xs text-slate-400">Lavanderia Magic Wash • Montecchia</span>
      </div>

      <!-- Contatti & Sede -->
      <div class="md:col-span-3 flex flex-col gap-2.5">
        <span class="text-xs font-bold text-white uppercase tracking-wider mb-1">
          Contatti Diretti
        </span>
        <div class="text-xs text-slate-300">
          <p class="font-semibold text-white">Arch. Nicolò Prando</p>
          <a href="mailto:info.studioprando@gmail.com" class="hover:text-[#1d77f2] transition-colors">info.studioprando@gmail.com</a>
        </div>
        <div class="text-xs text-slate-300 mt-1">
          <p class="font-semibold text-white">Samuele Ciman</p>
          <span class="text-slate-400">ESG & Impact Strategy</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 mt-2">
          San Giovanni Ilarione (VR) • Italia
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Copyright & Disclaimer Privacy -->
    <div class="pt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 text-xs text-slate-500">
      <p>© {currentYear} 4Loop. Tutti i diritti riservati.</p>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-6">
            <a href="/privacy-policy" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Informativa Privacy</a>
            <a href="/cookie-policy" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Cookie Policy</a>
       </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>